    "chunk_text": "\u00e6t heafod on \u00feam dissce, for\u00f0am \u00fee w\u00e6s kyninga dohtro AU29B1 On \u00feone ilcan d\u00e6g bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mnan tid sancta Sabine in Rome, \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6sse bi\u00f0 gemeted AU30A1 On \u00feone XXXan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s bisceopes gemynd sancti Felicis. AU30A2 W\u00e6s in \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre \u00fee is nemned Tubsocensi. AU30A3 \u00dea het Dioclitianus se kasere \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre gerefa \u00fe\u00e6t he gename on \u00feam biscope ealle AU30A6 \u00dea nolde se bisceop \u00f0a bec syllan, ac cw\u00e6\u00fe, Selre is \u00f0\u00e6t man me selfne b\u00e6rne \u00feonne \u00f0a AU30A8 \u00dea het se dema hine to o\u00ferum re\u00feran deman mid his preostum. AU30A9 Swa he w\u00e6s onsended on monige healfe to missenlicum demum, ond \u00e6ghwylc hine AU30A13 \u00dea \u00fereatode \u00fe\u00e6re burge gerefa \u00e6fter \u00feam bocum, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe he. AU30A14 Ic hi h\u00e6bbe, ac ic hi nelle syllan. AU30A15 \u00dea het se hine l\u00e6dan to \u00fe\u00e6re beheafduncga mid his preostum. AU30A17 On \u00e6f\u00e6nne hine man beheafdode, ond on \u00f0a ilcan tid w\u00e6s se mona in blod gecyrred. AU30A18 His m\u00e6ssepreost \u00fereowude mid him, \u00fe\u00e6s nama wes Ianuarius, ond his leorneras twegen, AU31A1 On \u00f0one XXXI deg \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe sancte Aidanis geleornis \u00f0\u00e6s bisceopes, \u00fe\u00e6s saule AU31A4 Se bisceop w\u00e6s Scyttisc, ond sanct",
